WEBVTT

00:08:29.509 --> 00:08:33.416
and for the rest of the hour of his talk

00:08:33.416 --> 00:08:38.049
Frank Nelson Cole busted that out.

00:08:38.049 --> 00:08:40.223
He had found the prime factors

00:08:40.223 --> 00:08:42.633
of (2 ^ 67) - 1.

00:08:42.633 --> 00:08:45.135
The room went berserk --

00:08:45.135 --> 00:08:46.955
(Laughter) --

00:08:46.955 --> 00:08:48.997
as Frank Nelson Cole sat down,

00:08:48.997 --> 00:08:52.344
having delivered the only talk in the history of mathematics

00:08:52.344 --> 00:08:55.153
with no words.

00:08:55.153 --> 00:08:57.840
He admitted afterwards it wasn't that hard to do.

00:08:57.840 --> 00:09:00.490
It took focus. It took dedication.